    "locked": false,
    "maintainer_can_modify": true,
    "title": "node: don't abort on invalid -dbcache in settings.json",
    "user": {
      "login": "0xShadowX",
      "id": 146137079,
      "node_id": "U_kgDOCLXf9w",
      "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/146137079?v=4",
      "gravatar_id": "",
      "url": "https://api.github.com/users/0xShadowX",
      "html_url": "https://github.com/0xShadowX",
      "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/0xShadowX/followers",
      "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/0xShadowX/following%7B/other_user%7D",
      "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/0xShadowX/gists%7B/gist_id%7D",
      "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/0xShadowX/starred%7B/owner%7D%7B/repo%7D",
      "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/0xShadowX/subscriptions",
      "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/0xShadowX/orgs",
      "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/0xShadowX/repos",
      "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/0xShadowX/events%7B/privacy%7D",
      "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/0xShadowX/received_events",
      "type": "User",
      "site_admin": false,
      "name": null,
      "patch_url": null
    },
    "body": "`LogOversizedDbCache` (added in #33333) is `noexcept`, but it reads `-dbcache` through `CalculateDbCacheBytes` -> `GetIntArg`. `GetIntArg` throws when settings.json has a number that isn't an integer or doesn't fit in int64, e.g. `{\"dbcache\": 4096.5}`. The exception hits the `noexcept` boundary and bitcoind aborts during startup:\r\n\r\n```\r\nlibc++abi: terminating due to uncaught exception of type std::runtime_error: JSON integer out of range\r\n```\r\n\r\nThis removes `noexcept`. The exception now reaches the handler in `AppInit`, and the node exits with status 1 and an error message instead of aborting:\r\n\r\n```\r\nEXCEPTION: St13runtime_error\r\nJSON integer out of range\r\nbitcoin in AppInit()\r\n```\r\n\r\nThe added case in `feature_settings.py` writes `{\"dbcache\": 4096.5}` to settings.json and checks that startup fails with that message from `AppInit`.\r\n",
